{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URLComponents"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The query subcomponent as an array of URLQueryItems."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/urlcomponents\/queryitems"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"queryItems","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"URLQueryItem","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URLQueryItem","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials12URLQueryItemV"},{"text":"]? { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"set","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLQueryItem"},{"type":"text","text":" represents a single key-value pair,"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note that a name may appear more than once in a single query string, so the name values are not guaranteed to be unique. If the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLComponents"},{"type":"text","text":" has an empty query component, returns an empty array. If the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLComponents"},{"type":"text","text":" has no query component, returns nil."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The setter combines an array containing any number of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLQueryItem"},{"type":"text","text":"s, each of which represents a single key-value pair, into a query string and sets the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLComponents"},{"type":"text","text":" query property. Passing an empty array sets the query component of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLComponents"},{"type":"text","text":" to an empty string. Passing nil removes the query component of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLComponents"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Note","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a name-value pair in a query is empty (i.e. the query string starts with ‘&’, ends with ‘&’, or has “&&” within it), you get a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLQueryItem"},{"type":"text","text":" with a zero-length name and a nil value. If a query’s name-value pair has nothing before the equals sign, you get a zero-length name. If a query’s name-value pair has nothing after the equals sign, you get a zero-length value. If a query’s name-value pair has no equals sign, the query name-value pair string is the name and you get a nil value."}]}],"type":"aside"}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"platforms":[{"beta":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"10.10","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"9.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"2.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false}],"modules":[{"name":"FoundationEssentials"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"queryItems","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"URLQueryItem","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials12URLQueryItemV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]?","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Instance